<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <!-- This is an html comment! Inside the head we add our metadata, Links to CSS JS and fonts. -->
         <meta charset="utf-8">
         <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
        <title>Week 1 Learning HTML</title>
        <meta name="description" content="This week we are looking at the basic HTML structure ">
        <meta name="robots" content="nofollow, noindex">
    </head>
    <!-- everything in the body is visible to the user -->
    <body>
        <header>
            <h1>This is the main title (there can only be one)</h1>
            <nav>
                <menu>
                    <li>
                        <a href="index.html">I am a link label</a>
                    </li>
                </menu>
            </nav>
        </header>
        <main>
            <section>
                <h2>I am an h2</h2>
                <div>
                    <h3>I am an h3</h3>
                    <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Odio corrupti quo perspiciatis, dolores eaque consectetur neque deserunt veritatis, recusandae nisi nulla reiciendis sed soluta, voluptates blanditiis ex libero incidunt. Nihil, hic! Quasi iste laborum natus?</p>
                    <p class="class"></p>
                    <p id="class"></p>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section>
                <form method="post" action="somefile.php">
                    <!--notice the layout of the 1st 2-->
                    <input type="text" placeholder="some text" required>
                    <input type="email" placeholder="some email" required>
                    <br><!--this is really the only time to use a br-->
                    <label>Password:</label>
                    <input type="password">
                    <br>
                    <label>Email:</label>
                    <p><input type="email"</p>
                    <button type="submit">Submit</button>
                    <p>or</p>
                    <input type="submit">
                </form>
            </section>
        </main>
        <aside>
            <article>
                <h3>I am a related product</h3>
                <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet.</p>
                <a href="#">Read More</a>
            </article>

        </aside>
        <footer>
            <h6>&copy; 2026 lesson code</h6>
        </footer>
    </body>
</html>